{"seq":1,"slug":"multi-currency-coupon","title":"多币种券金额与展示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/coupon-center-lifecycle/global-coupon/multi-currency-coupon","wordCount":2714,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"多币种券金额与展示\">多币种券金额与展示</h1><p>一张「满 200 减 50」的券在跨境业务里是四个问题而不是一个：以哪种货币记账、按哪个汇率折算、折算差额谁承担、以及不同市场里这个门槛是否等价。当同一个批次同时投放新加坡、印尼、巴西与德国时，运营想表达的是「一次减免约占客单价 25%」这个<strong>经济意图</strong>，而不是「固定减 50 元」这个<strong>数值事实</strong>。把意图固化成数值，就会在汇率波动或市场定价差异下得到完全不同的实际力度。</p>\n<p>本文处理券的金额侧：币种归属、折算与舍入、展示口径、以及跨币种结算差额。券的通用金额模型与算价接口见 <a href=\"../coupon-model-batch/coupon-template-types\">券模板、券种与适用范围</a>；市场与站点适用范围见 <a href=\"market-scope-coupon\">券的市场/站点适用范围</a>；本地化投放规则见 <a href=\"localized-coupon-rule\">本地化发券规则与节日营销</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-券的币种必须与结算币种分离\">核心概念：券的币种必须与结算币种分离</h2><p>券有三个可能不同的币种，混淆它们是跨境券系统最常见的缺陷来源：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>币种角色</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>谁决定</th>\n<th>典型取值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定义币种</td>\n<td>模板里的面额以什么货币表达</td>\n<td>模板创建者</td>\n<td>平台记账币（如 USD）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可用币种</td>\n<td>这张券能在哪些币种的订单上使用</td>\n<td>批次的市场配置</td>\n<td>SGD、IDR、BRL、EUR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算币种</td>\n<td>订单实际支付与记账的货币</td>\n<td>买家所在市场</td>\n<td>同上，通常等于可用币种之一</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者可以全部不同。例如一个用 USD 定义面额的模板，允许在 SGD 与 IDR 市场使用，那么它在一次 IDR 结算的订单上必须折算成 IDR 参与算价。<strong>折算不能发生在券的面额上（那会污染券的语义），而应发生在算价的那一刻</strong>，并且折算结果要写回订单的优惠明细以便审计。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    T[&quot;模板&lt;br/&gt;面额 5 USD(定义币种)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;批次&lt;br/&gt;市场 SG / ID / BR&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; R1[&quot;汇率服务&lt;br/&gt;快照率 + 版本号&quot;]&#10;    R1 --&gt; C1[&quot;SG 订单&lt;br/&gt;SGD 结算&quot;]&#10;    R1 --&gt; C2[&quot;ID 订单&lt;br/&gt;IDR 结算&quot;]&#10;    R1 --&gt; C3[&quot;BR 订单&lt;br/&gt;BRL 结算&quot;]&#10;    C1 --&gt; O1[&quot;算价:折算为 SGD&lt;br/&gt;写入优惠明细&quot;]&#10;    C2 --&gt; O2[&quot;算价:折算为 IDR&lt;br/&gt;按最小单位舍入&quot;]&#10;    C3 --&gt; O3[&quot;算价:折算为 BRL&lt;br/&gt;写入优惠明细&quot;]&#10;    O1 --&gt; SET[&quot;订单结算与记账&quot;]&#10;    O2 --&gt; SET&#10;    O3 --&gt; SET&#10;    SET --&gt; DIFF[&quot;折算差额会计入&lt;br/&gt;营销费用科目&quot;]\">graph TD\n    T[\"模板&lt;br/&gt;面额 5 USD(定义币种)\"] --&gt; B[\"批次&lt;br/&gt;市场 SG / ID / BR\"]\n    B --&gt; R1[\"汇率服务&lt;br/&gt;快照率 + 版本号\"]\n    R1 --&gt; C1[\"SG 订单&lt;br/&gt;SGD 结算\"]\n    R1 --&gt; C2[\"ID 订单&lt;br/&gt;IDR 结算\"]\n    R1 --&gt; C3[\"BR 订单&lt;br/&gt;BRL 结算\"]\n    C1 --&gt; O1[\"算价:折算为 SGD&lt;br/&gt;写入优惠明细\"]\n    C2 --&gt; O2[\"算价:折算为 IDR&lt;br/&gt;按最小单位舍入\"]\n    C3 --&gt; O3[\"算价:折算为 BRL&lt;br/&gt;写入优惠明细\"]\n    O1 --&gt; SET[\"订单结算与记账\"]\n    O2 --&gt; SET\n    O3 --&gt; SET\n    SET --&gt; DIFF[\"折算差额会计入&lt;br/&gt;营销费用科目\"]</pre><p>图中最右侧的差额是必须显式处理的：券以 USD 定义、订单以 IDR 结算，两者之间必然存在折算尾差，而财务需要知道这部分差异记在哪里，而不是让它消失在四舍五入里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"折算-舍入与最小货币单位\">折算、舍入与最小货币单位</h2><p>折算的核心公式本身很简单，难点全在舍入与精度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>settle</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>round</mtext><mrow><mtext>  </mtext><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>target</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>def</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mtext>def</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>target</mtext></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{\\text{settle}} = \\text{round}_{\\;u(\\text{target})}\\!\\left(v_{\\text{def}} \\times r_{\\text{def}\\to\\text{target}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">settle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1052em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.3253em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">def</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">def</span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(\\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是目标货币的最小单位步长。步长不是统一的小数两位：按 ISO 4217 的小数位定义，日元与韩元为 0 位（步长 1），越南盾与印尼盾在标准里分别记为 0 位与 2 位（流通中通常按 100 或 1000 取整），美元、新加坡元、欧元、印度卢比与巴西雷亚尔均为 2 位（来源：ISO 4217, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_4217）。把步长硬编码成两位小数，会在\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_4217）。把步长硬编码成两位小数，会在</a> JPY 与 IDR 市场造出 <code>¥1234.00</code> 与 <code>Rp 1234.00</code> 这种既不符合当地习惯、又在支付通道被拒的金额。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>货币</th>\n<th>最小单位步长</th>\n<th>券面额建议取整</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>USD / SGD / EUR</td>\n<td>0.01</td>\n<td>0.5 / 1 / 5</td>\n<td>常规两位小数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JPY / KRW</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>10 / 100 / 1000</td>\n<td>无小数位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IDR</td>\n<td>1（展示常取 100）</td>\n<td>1000 / 5000 / 10000</td>\n<td>面额数值大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VND</td>\n<td>1（展示常取 1000）</td>\n<td>10000 / 50000</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BRL / MXN</td>\n<td>0.01</td>\n<td>1 / 5 / 10</td>\n<td>常规两位小数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INR</td>\n<td>0.01</td>\n<td>5 / 10 / 50</td>\n<td>常见心理价位以 5 为单位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>舍入方向必须是「不增加平台让利」</strong>。也就是说券的折算值应当向下取整到步长，而不是四舍五入。理由是一张按 <code>5 USD</code> 定义的券在 IDR 下若向上取整，平台的实际让利会略高于设计值；当批次量达到百万级时，这个差异会在财务上可见。向下取整的代价是用户看到的减免略少于按汇率算出的精确值，而这个差异在用户侧是不可感知的（因为金额本身就很大）。</p>\n<p>舍入还需要注意<strong>多处舍入的累积</strong>。一次订单可能同时使用多张券，若对每张券分别舍入，累积误差可达数倍步长。可行做法是先按精确值求和、再对总额舍入一次，然后把总额分解回各券的明细（分解时按比例或按顺序）。这个顺序对账务很重要，因为账务是按明细记账的：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mtext>round</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>round</mtext><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i \\text{round}(v_i) \\;\\neq\\; \\text{round}\\!\\left(\\sum_i v_i\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>两者最多相差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 个步长。选择「先和后舍」可以让平台的总额让利精确受控，代价是明细之间需要一次差额分配。这个分配规则必须写进文档而不是留给实现自由决定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"汇率来源与快照\">汇率来源与快照</h2><p>券折算用的汇率不能是算价那一刻的实时汇率，原因有两个：<strong>可复现</strong>与<strong>可解释</strong>。用户下单后需要能解释「为什么当时显示优惠 12.50 SGD」，如果汇率是实时取的，事后无法复现这个数字；财务也需要一个固定的汇率来做账，而不是让同一笔交易在不同时间得到不同记账值。</p>\n<p>因此汇率必须以<strong>版本化快照</strong>的形式参与折算：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;rateTableId&quot;: &quot;rt_2026_09_26_0300&quot;,&#10;  &quot;base&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rates&quot;: { &quot;SGD&quot;: 1.3421, &quot;IDR&quot;: 15870.0, &quot;BRL&quot;: 5.4218, &quot;JPY&quot;: 147.32 },&#10;  &quot;validFrom&quot;: &quot;2026-09-26T03:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;validTo&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T03:00:00Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rateTableId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rt_2026_09_26_0300\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"base\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rates\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"SGD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.3421</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"IDR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15870.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"BRL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5.4218</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"JPY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">147.32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"validFrom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-26T03:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"validTo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T03:00:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>订单在创建时记录 <code>rateTableId</code>，之后所有券的折算、退款的反向折算、以及报表的汇总都用同一个版本的汇率。这让「一笔订单的金额在所有系统里一致」成为可能。缺少这一步的系统会在退款时用到新汇率，从而产生用户可见的差额——退款金额与支付金额不一致，是跨境业务中投诉率最高的缺陷之一。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>用哪个汇率</th>\n<th>版本来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>下单算价</td>\n<td>订单创建时的快照</td>\n<td>订单记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付记账</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td>订单记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全额退款</td>\n<td>原订单汇率</td>\n<td>订单记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分退款</td>\n<td>原订单汇率</td>\n<td>订单记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>财务日终报表</td>\n<td>当日快照</td>\n<td>日终汇率表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>券让利成本归集</td>\n<td>原订单汇率</td>\n<td>订单记录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「财务日终报表用当日快照」与「逐单用原订单汇率」的差额是<strong>汇兑损益</strong>，它应当被单独归集而不是被抹平。承认这笔差额的存在，是跨境财务能对得上账的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"展示口径-折算还是本地面额\">展示口径：折算还是本地面额</h2><p>用户界面上显示什么金额，是一个比折算算法更影响转化的决策。有三种可选口径：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>展示</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>折算面额</td>\n<td>按快照汇率折算后的本地金额</td>\n<td>与结算一致</td>\n<td>数字不美观（Rp 79,350）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地面额</td>\n<td>为每个市场单独定义整数面额</td>\n<td>美观、符合心理价位</td>\n<td>各市场力度不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>百分比表达</td>\n<td>「立减 25%」+ 封顶</td>\n<td>跨市场语义一致</td>\n<td>用户难以预估实际金额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中成熟平台多用<strong>第三种与第二种的组合</strong>：模板上声明「期望让利率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 与封顶 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>」，各市场在生效时把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 换算成本地整数面额并冻结进批次配置。这样运营表达的是经济意图，用户看到的是美观的本地数字，财务拿到的是明确的本地面额（不需要每次算汇率）。</p>\n<p>组合口径的实现要求是：<strong>折算只发生在配置期，不发生在算价期</strong>。也就是说，批次配置里每个市场都有一份固化的本地面额，算价时直接取用。这消除了算价路径上的汇率依赖，也让「为什么这张券是 Rp 79,000 而不是 79,350」有一个可查的解释——它来自配置冻结时的取整规则。</p>\n<p>封顶参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的处理同理，但多了一层：折扣券在低客单价市场可能永远不会触发封顶，而在高客单价市场经常触发。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的市场本地化不只是货币换算，还要按各市场客单价分布调整，否则「8 折封顶 50」在小额市场等价于无封顶折扣，在大额市场等价于固定减 50。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨币种让利的成本归集\">跨币种让利的成本归集</h2><p>券的成本最终要记到某个科目上，而跨境券的成本归集面临一个额外问题：<strong>成本发生在哪个币种</strong>。若以 USD 定义、以 IDR 结算，则平台在 IDR 侧记账的让利额，与以 USD 汇总的营销预算之间存在差额。</p>\n<p>处理上有两条清晰的路径：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>定义币种归集</strong>：所有市场的让利都按原订单汇率折算回 USD，汇总到营销预算。优点是预算口径统一（与批次预算是同一币种），缺点是每个市场都要做一次折算。</li>\n<li><strong>结算币种归集</strong>：按各市场本币直接汇总，预算也按市场分别设定。优点是没有折损，缺点是无法回答「这次全球活动总共花了多少」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>批次的预算池见 <a href=\"../coupon-model-batch/batch-budget\">券批次、总量与预算</a>，它的记账币种需要与归集路径一致。最简可行且实用的方案是：<strong>批次预算以定义币种设定，各市场让利按原订单汇率折算回定义币种消耗预算</strong>，同时在各市场本币维度保留一份明细供本地财务使用。两套数字来自同一次折算，因此它们之间的差异是可解释的。</p>\n<p>这里有一条硬性约束：<strong>折算必须在券被核销的那一刻完成并固化</strong>，不能在日终批量重算。理由与汇率快照一致——重算会用到不同版本的汇率，让同一次核销在不同时间得出不同成本。核销时固化让利额（含汇率版本）也是 <a href=\"../lifecycle-ops/writeoff-recovery\">核销、退回与风控防刷</a> 中效果归因能算准的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>券有定义币种、可用币种、结算币种三个角色，<strong>三者可以全不同</strong>；折算发生在算价或配置期，而不是污染券的面额语义。</li>\n<li>舍入必须向下取整到目标货币的最小单位步长，且<strong>先求和再舍入</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\text{round}(v_i) \\neq \\text{round}(\\sum v_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），差额分配规则要显式定义。</li>\n<li>汇率以<strong>版本化快照</strong>参与，订单记录 <code>rateTableId</code>；退款用原订单汇率，日终报表用当日汇率，两者差额作为汇兑损益单独归集。</li>\n<li>展示优先用「期望让利率 + 封顶」在配置期固化为各市场本地面额，算价路径不依赖实时汇率。</li>\n<li>成本归集以定义币种汇总预算、以结算币种保留明细，两套数字同源；<strong>核销时固化让利额与汇率版本</strong>，不做日终重算。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多币种券金额与展示","id":"多币种券金额与展示"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：券的币种必须与结算币种分离","id":"核心概念-券的币种必须与结算币种分离"},{"level":2,"text":"折算、舍入与最小货币单位","id":"折算-舍入与最小货币单位"},{"level":2,"text":"汇率来源与快照","id":"汇率来源与快照"},{"level":2,"text":"展示口径：折算还是本地面额","id":"展示口径-折算还是本地面额"},{"level":2,"text":"跨币种让利的成本归集","id":"跨币种让利的成本归集"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"用户券卡包与状态管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/coupon-center-lifecycle/grant-wallet/coupon-wallet"},"next":{"title":"券的市场/站点适用范围","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/coupon-center-lifecycle/global-coupon/market-scope-coupon"}}